- Integration health and failure management.
- API deprecation and migration workflows.
- Developer documentation and sandbox support.
- Partner integration monitoring.
- Security incident integration.
- Audit and compliance evidence.
- Administrative control and operational reporting.

This module must govern APIs, not replace their underlying business services.

